{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Yongcheon High School, Turned into a Labyrinth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the prestigious Yongcheon High School, an old ghost story has been whispered for decades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say that at midnight on a full moon, <strong>the cries of schoolgirls echo from the sealed occult club room in the basement.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by curiosity, four students performed a forbidden ritual and awakened the sealed spirits, plunging the school into a labyrinth of ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you must fight through this endless midnight self-study, facing the spirits that haunt the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talismans That Pierce Spirits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girls have inherited shamanic power, allowing them to wield talismans. Fire projectiles that ricochet off walls and objects to strike talismans in a unique combat system, and banish the spirits that block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talismans &amp; Relics: Endless Deckbuilding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cleared battle rewards you with forbidden talismans. Combine talismans and mysterious relics to forge a cursed deck. With the school changing every run, your choices will decide whether you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four Distinct Students</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haneul (Archery Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sumi (Kendo Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arin (Chemistry Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirae (Track &amp; Field)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character wields a unique weapon and fighting style, offering different tactical approaches to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Folklore and School Ghost Stories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies are more than simple spirits. Ghosts from <strong>Korean school ghost stories</strong> and traditional folklore manifest into reality. In dark classrooms, endless corridors, and sealed chambers, you will face beings once thought to exist only in legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three main chapters to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 talismans and relics to build your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unique characters with distinct weapon styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A labyrinthine school structure that changes every run, with spirits that grow stronger over time</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Giant That Splits the Sea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3823430/c167ab0d4ddd996dc3c42c3cc7a57b1e2ea54061.jpg"},{"name":"Nightmare of Nine Heads","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3823430/d711ab14dbd7bba27a724ba427be7cec3dd4fe8e.jpg"},{"name":"Shadow That Crushes the Head","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3823430/9626f1afe53869584307ed19373112dd992f0930.jpg"},{"name":"Become the Ultimate Life Form","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3823430/ea9177930c937297f7653fa56153be4252a92d39.jpg"},{"name":"Punching out on time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3823430/fc0d99ea7c135485de5845f36e5118a0521ddbd7.jpg"},{"name":"Blood for the Blood God!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3823430/5370c38ce15ed7222da355725e0b0d8a98863394.jpg"},{"name":"I CAST FIST!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3823430/76de3287dac4669683606ec439bcd7191550c05c.jpg"},{"name":"Overprotective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3823430/884333da3e7fa8cc725d2be072cce37b32dd96d9.jpg"},{"name":"THIS IS THE GREATEST HIGH!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3823430/855c7b8b69552784f6cfe0d0462a900318faf075.jpg"},{"name":"I Won\u2019t Stop Beating You Until You Cry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3823430/0be009965968f8146daba8dcbce92fa7a2605608.jpg"}],"total":59},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3823430?t=1773810712","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3823430?t=1773810712","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/a24331537e84feab565555c5ff1ebf719c3ad0fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773810712","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/a24331537e84feab565555c5ff1ebf719c3ad0fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773810712","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3879230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Yongcheon High School, Turned into a Labyrinth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the prestigious Yongcheon High School, an old ghost story has been whispered for decades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say that at midnight on a full moon, <strong>the cries of schoolgirls echo from the sealed occult club room in the basement.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by curiosity, four students performed a forbidden ritual and awakened the sealed spirits, plunging the school into a labyrinth of ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you must fight through this endless midnight self-study, facing the spirits that haunt the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talismans That Pierce Spirits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girls have inherited shamanic power, allowing them to wield talismans. Fire projectiles that ricochet off walls and objects to strike talismans in a unique combat system, and banish the spirits that block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talismans &amp; Relics: Endless Deckbuilding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cleared battle rewards you with forbidden talismans. Combine talismans and mysterious relics to forge a cursed deck. With the school changing every run, your choices will decide whether you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four Distinct Students</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haneul (Archery Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sumi (Kendo Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arin (Chemistry Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirae (Track &amp; Field)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character wields a unique weapon and fighting style, offering different tactical approaches to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Folklore and School Ghost Stories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies are more than simple spirits. Ghosts from <strong>Korean school ghost stories</strong> and traditional folklore manifest into reality. In dark classrooms, endless corridors, and sealed chambers, you will face beings once thought to exist only in legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three main chapters to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 talismans and relics to build your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unique characters with distinct weapon styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A labyrinthine school structure that changes every run, with spirits that grow stronger over time</p></li></ul>","developers":["Geniesoft Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/a35c569e2585032ad1d282257b80f6d48292db8d/header.jpg?t=1773810712","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>",